{"id":"nce1-103","book":"nce1","numbers":[103,104],"label":"Lesson 103–104","titleEn":"The French Test","titleCn":"法语考试","audio":"media/lessons/nce1/103.mp3","lines":[{"t":3.54,"en":"The French test","cn":"法语测试"},{"t":6.77,"en":"Listen to the tape then answer this question.","cn":"先听这段录音，然后再回答这个问题。"},{"t":12.82,"en":"How long did the exam last?","cn":"考试持续了多长时间？"},{"t":17.91,"en":"How was the exam, Richard?","cn":"理查德，考试考得怎么样？"},{"t":20.8,"en":"Not too bad.","cn":"还不错。"},{"t":22.56,"en":"I think I passed in English and Mathematics.","cn":"我想我英语和数学都考及格了。"},{"t":27.28,"en":"The questions were very easy.","cn":"这些问题非常简单。"},{"t":30.34,"en":"How about you, Gary?","cn":"那你呢，加里？"},{"t":33.99,"en":"The English and Maths papers weren't easy enough for me.","cn":"英语和数学的试卷对我来说难度确实太大了一些。"},{"t":39.98,"en":"I hope I haven't failed.","cn":"我希望我没有失败。"},{"t":42.79,"en":"I think I failed the French paper.","cn":"我觉得我法语考试没及格。"},{"t":46.6,"en":"I could answer sixteen of the questions.","cn":"我能够回答其中的十六个问题。"},{"t":50.56,"en":"They were very easy.","cn":"它们非常简单。"},{"t":53.03,"en":"But I couldn't answer the rest.","cn":"但我无法回答其余的问题。"},{"t":56.21,"en":"They were too difficult for me.","cn":"这些对我来说太难了。"},{"t":60.29,"en":"French tests are awful, aren't they?","cn":"法语考试真的很难考，对吧？"},{"t":63.85,"en":"I hate them.","cn":"我讨厌他们。"},{"t":65.72,"en":"I'm sure I've got a low mark.","cn":"我肯定我的分数很低。"},{"t":70.13,"en":"Oh, cheer up!","cn":"哦，振作起来吧！"},{"t":72.73,"en":"Perhaps we didn't do too badly.","cn":"也许我们的表现还不错。"},{"t":77.01,"en":"The guy next to me wrote his name at the top of the paper.","cn":"坐在我旁边的人在纸的顶部写下了自己的名字。"},{"t":82.53,"en":"Yes?","cn":"是的？"},{"t":84.11,"en":"Then he sat there and looked at it for three hours!","cn":"然后他就坐在那里，盯着那个东西看了三个小时！"},{"t":89.36,"en":"He didn't write a word!","cn":"他一个字都没写！"}],"words":[{"word":"exam","phonetic":["ig'zæm"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"考试","us":"media/words/nce1/w0686_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0686_e.mp3"},{"word":"pass","phonetic":["pɑ:s"],"pos":"v